<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN"
        "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd">
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"/>
</head>
<body>

$recepient,<br />
Please be advised that $rejector rejected your $benefitType benefit request. <br/>

<p><b>Request Details:</b><br />
Benefit type: $benefitType <br />
Requested Quantity: $requestedQuantity $unitType <br />
Description: $description <br />
Date: $date <br />
<b>Rejection note:</b> $rejectionReason
</p>
Click <a href="$link">here</a> to view the Benefit request.*

<p>* If you are not able to click on the link, you can copy and paste the following address into your web browser:
<p>

<p style="border-bottom: 1px solid #cccccc">&nbsp;</p>
<p>
    <span style="color: #0033FF">$link</span>
</p>

</body>
</html>